{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52852","headline":"掌上莲峰赋附歌 · 吕令问","name":"掌上莲峰赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苔至滑兮石无踪，道不可得，仙不可逢。\n傥赐一丸生羽翼，愿轻举於三峰。\n（见《文苑英华》卷二八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕令问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}